  "new_arithmetic_scope": "Whole low-digit primitive hyperbolic catalog has O(log m) rows per tag; weighted cone and high-digit raw energy dominate ALL higher-digit/factor-advised choices. Full Euclidean ray family inherits cover obstruction via low-digit heavy/light tag trimming using the compiled total packet budget.",
